@baseUrl = http://localhost:5223

### Successful Email OTP Verification Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "amr@example.com",
  "otp": "482913",
  "purpose": "EmailVerification"
}

### Successful Phone OTP Verification Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "+201234567890",
  "otp": "482913",
  "purpose": "PhoneVerification"
}

### Unknown User returns Generic Success Response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "unknown@example.com",
  "otp": "482913",
  "purpose": "EmailVerification"
}

### Invalid OTP Format (e.g. less than 6 digits) returns Validation Error
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "amr@example.com",
  "otp": "123",
  "purpose": "EmailVerification"
}

### Missing Purpose returns Validation Error
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "amr@example.com",
  "otp": "482913",
  "purpose": ""
}
